            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Refers to 1 kg of tallow at rendering plant. Since the process of meat and bone meal production is nearly the same as the production of tallow (all steps are common except the milling of the meal), a physical allocation of the processes has been applied. The inventory can therefore also be used as an approximation for meat and bone meal.;
Synonyms: animal fat, Talg; 
UUID: f6655fa7-785d-3dcf-8640-017969ab9db2</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
